# Combine positive and negative

variable C1${dir} equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C15 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C15 equal 0.5*(2.4041483025922+${C1pos})
variable C15 equal 0.5*(2.4041483025922+-1.2844200440717)
variable C2${dir} equal 0.5*(${C2neg}+${C2pos})
variable C25 equal 0.5*(${C2neg}+${C2pos})
variable C25 equal 0.5*(0.933873294984851+${C2pos})
variable C25 equal 0.5*(0.933873294984851+0.199808440844045)
